"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5651458","7052165","679"],"w":["glosskey",0]},{"t":"He estado dando vueltas con la emoción de elegir habitación y empezar a mudarnos.","e":"I was just so darn tootin' and poopin' with excitement to pick rooms and start moving in.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"9d931c21d993541e57d8f6148e939822","i":"184dfc42fd4ea20d4aef352a428485f4","r":"6146702:7000184:60:2774208","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6146702","7000184","60"],"w":["leaf",1]}],[{"t":"No, mudarnos para acá nunca fue un error.","e":"No, moving here wasn't a mistake.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"5d734f68418974cb31d6f45c24fb38e4","i":"b4e47a943e5af7ca66b86a31cc9951d0","r":"5098994:6716603:604:1459170","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5098994","6716603","604"],"w":["glosskey",0]},{"t":"El mudarnos a Berlín fue por ti.","e":"Moving to Berlin was for you.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"a9629b7f231f1e39c8ba2ecf07939730","i":"a35ecca9b94a7a2b00607c230438840c","r":"6002432:7036257:659:3644226","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6002432","7036257","659"],"w":["glosskey",0]},{"t":"- Estaba planeando mudarnos mas tarde hoy.","e":"- I was planning on moving us out later today.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"215e0fce81a629cbf07f72d699c1617b","i":"0f17b4e6ed5766db8113eae4ee85cc31","r":"6174392:7002215:571:3792783","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6174392","7002215","571"],"w":["glosskey",0]}],[{"t":"Quizás deberíamos mudarnos a un lugar más pequeño.","e":"Maybe we should move to something smaller.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"b91435f679acabf7124b1eb343856870","i":"2bcbfec8f1e1207045f52f42f094970a","r":"5078330:6897693:64:1436826","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5078330","6897693","64"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"No puedo creer que vayamos a mudarnos pasado mañana.","e":"I can't believe we're moving the day after tomorrow.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"d906aa3b1b9769124d07a8da423e61a5","i":"2e52baa981d95fd4c58693a94ee5a263","r":"5465504:6613643:421:2092830","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5465504","6613643","421"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Vamos a mudarnos porque he encontrado el lugar perfecto para vuestro hermano.","e":"We're moving because I found the perfect situation for your brother.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"272d8d33b2459ff4ccf9ee247b827bd6","i":"34d1311d84b4477d65f6ec19bf48a74c","r":"5843160:6742557:62:2538984","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5843160","6742557","62"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Bueno, vamos a mudarnos juntos, y necesitaremos un segundo dormitorio.","e":"- Well, we're gonna be moving in together and we're gonna need a second bedroom.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"513421aea424f17d5562c374d62e9c38","i":"5e6cfd35e6f89a7ad2dd1765aa83d36d","r":"2783926:6947830:145:186900","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["2783926","6947830","145"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Y que gente ha muerto aquí, ¡y que debemos mudarnos, ahora!","e":"And that people have died here, and that we should move, now!","s":"opensubtitles","x":"41c52bed303c4fb84d779b95d2ee114e","i":"7df119cd71eebc767a6b2b0e1fdd1abb","r":"5431600:6976752:916 917:3201435","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5431600","6976752","916 917"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Creo que quizás deberíamos mudarnos a otro sitio.","e":"I think maybe we should move somewhere else.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"1e4bc30851ba9841e2c8f07cb5023e36","i":"9498b10474a79e277a79f29750030bf7","r":"5465506:6621350:420:2093497","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5465506","6621350","420"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Acabamos de mudarnos, ¿podría abrir la puerta, por favor?","e":"We've just moved in, could you open the door please?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"d366982af152e40af05a9e32fbfa2100","i":"e18673b2c8aabb404116db5010ff35ee","r":"5186714:6974224:494:1583937","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5186714","6974224","494"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Tal vez debamos mudarnos en un mes o dos.","e":"We may have to move in a month or two.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"8f5e3b7fac33d162517466d0c6aed04c","i":"f7af2ca228e57dcf093e8466ab080d3a","r":"6199774:6931970:103:3827386","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6199774","6931970","103"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Es que pensábamos en mudarnos a algún lado donde pudiéramos comprar una casa.","e":"It's just we were thinking we might want to move somewhere... where we could actually afford to buy a house.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"9173a09f6ad8d214f11d1713d6cb6cc3","i":"d762e3ee244d41879af59566e803ec2d","r":"1781058:7005703:53:2901202","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["1781058","7005703","53"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"El último tío nos ayudó a mudarnos a casa de Jay.","e":"The last guy helped us move into Jay's house.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"613bcddb5f6308c73abbff9ea1761ec5","i":"0956d121f49e7cffe403c335aa4eb75c","r":"5042722:6462164:498:1383032","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5042722","6462164","498"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Mi mujer y yo acabamos de mudarnos de Boston.","e":"My wife and I just moved in from Boston last week.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"43c7ac2006fa6ba7cc0db1cd95bfe67a","i":"37c740e4d632bf263816736b09cdae6c","r":"6021918:7048509:200:3668009","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6021918","7048509","200"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Tal vez tengamos que mudarnos de casa.","e":"We might have to move out of our house.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"eb2c325118554f8ad0e728d5c9449400","i":"352c8672f9b794f7038be6fcfc14dcfa","r":"4361050:6844270:400:621309","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4361050","6844270","400"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Podemos mudarnos en la próxima semana.","e":"We can move in next week.","s":"tatoeba","x":"98e8cf60ae86b48baf49b06fcecd13c2","i":"5c4f0d1a2aa557596889970e3331f184","r":"13367275:12879956","c":"mexicanhere","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/13367275","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/13367275","b":"Tatoeba sentence #13367275 by mexicanhere; English translation #12879956 by Ussis","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/13367275","tu":1,"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Es por eso que tenemos que mudarnos.","e":"That is why we have to move.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"be24111b66a4358040b78aea7dcde96e","i":"7027f8cc962576b0881522a182248de0","r":"5182070:6482123:288:1571797","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5182070","6482123","288"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"¿Por qué tuvimos que mudarnos aquí?","e":"Why did we have to move here?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"5c915607bb67739c7da906d41a9229e5","i":"fa4d74b979d408ba93a1cb36f1641f0c","r":"5432150:6565123:42:2029867","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5432150","6565123","42"],"w":["tuple",0]}],[{"t":"Mi marido tiene un trabajo nuevo, así que tenemos que mudarnos.","e":"My husband got a new job, so we have to relocate.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"37e68344e8b9797201bb50a0739daaa5","i":"975df2985a1ce18486a5875c9de87716","r":"4653170:6771974:548:903645","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4653170","6771974","548"],"w":["tuple",0]}]]},"1a6cf606":{"m":[[{"t":"Voy a mudar de casa el próximo mes.","e":"I am moving next month.","s":"tatoeba","x":"37b6895c8e2f89cb77b8e65b39315f92","i":"101d50ee9a6f8ef232a03936b4f4cc19","r":"625820:325030","c":"darinmex","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/625820","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/625820","b":"Tatoeba sentence #625820 by darinmex; English translation #325030 by CC","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/625820","tu":1,"w":["glosskey",0]},{"t":"¿Por qué más se iba a mudar aquí?","e":"Why else would she move here?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"94c6dcbb0c59e9f0529f13903a63ef74","i":"3d31423586282e3e148541a27c1db9a4","r":"5232516:6491981:8:1715529","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5232516","6491981","8"],"w":["glosskey",0]},{"t":"¿Entonces, cuando es que se van a mudar?","e":"So when are you guys moving out?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"c9494af68aba211fec512fdc15165c6d","i":"79c62d1b1ba60c0b3f0ba98c09e598ef","r":"5539292:6722921:463:2222777","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5539292","6722921","463"],"w":["glosskey",0]},{"t":"Se acaba de mudar de la capital.","e":"She just moved here from the capital.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"a9cfc6a5b0c7a70f3c50f94c206c7294","i":"624d4a0f83e69285035468a63d071d12","r":"6157384:7035543:515:2785659","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6157384","7035543","515"],"w":["glosskey",0]}],[{"t":"Bueno, sí, no. \"Nosotras\" no la haríamos mudar a otro sitio.","e":"Well, yeah, no. \"We\" wouldn't move her anywhere.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"c2924c73094b34ee19ee319db9c1f78b","i":"04871cee9ee4e748c46e04456a06593c","r":"5614176:6601474:346:2335120","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5614176","6601474","346"],"w":["glosskey",0]},{"t":"Me está ayudando a mudar.","e":"He's helping me to move out.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"e5a6f54f49c4727943377f5e142e1b80","i":"68341b33a3166965c6bb2b35b3c0298b","r":"5108476:6864449:548:1462278","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5108476","6864449","548"],"w":["glosskey",0]},{"t":"Deberíamos volver a mudar algo.","e":"We should move something again.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"77d61967a991daf0d4c9f21c81d868fb","i":"d92a1e38fd7cf280b82ceb5342a2736b","r":"5513490:6912416:299:3233501","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5513490","6912416","299"],"w":["glosskey",0]}],[{"t":"Me tuve que mudar a casa porque mamá no podía aceptarlo.","e":"I had to move back to the house because Mom couldn't take it.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"3bcd3ba1fa3d21fd9f086130e295c5c3","i":"10a1b4d09f14be9232cd050b03fec3d7","r":"5004006:6558093:431:1347720","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5004006","6558093","431"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"No me puedo mudar, porque entonces ella sabría que yo sé.","e":"I can't move out, 'cause then she'll know that I know.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"d7c2a84f34afc4eea64fb6609379720f","i":"16f01c51f289f5118e6020162d9897ca","r":"6059518:6924424:156:3689029","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6059518","6924424","156"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Si tuviera más dinero me podría mudar a una casa más grande.","e":"If I had more money, I could move to a bigger house.","s":"tatoeba","x":"04de601928fe434b71d45ba692d6c7f0","i":"30a7e067b5e29a90df423cebfd245d8b","r":"558572:30514","c":"Shishir","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/558572","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/558572","b":"Tatoeba sentence #558572 by Shishir; English translation #30514 by CK","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/558572","tu":1,"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Entonces, ¿cuándo nos vamos a mudar con Lee?","e":"So, when are we moving in with Lee?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"07335fbddf9848dac6a26bb7328422e5","i":"32a791b2322231ffb78cd948161293df","r":"3910814:6836001:1225:439628","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3910814","6836001","1225"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Me... nos acabamos de mudar de fuera de la ciudad.","e":"I... we just moved in from way out of town.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"dc8fd1c3cb04b776d9fbada09a529eb7","i":"97ad04c6ac92b4165945a3533b681c47","r":"4877414:6549047:209:1193708","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4877414","6549047","209"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"No hagan que me vuelva a mudar con ustedes.","e":"Don't make me move back in.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"4f9562ec9ed32deaba00d2f84c0f0e4f","i":"b3db4cad3feb53275fdcd806b63783ea","r":"5743998:7032006:985:2460351","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5743998","7032006","985"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"No nos vamos a mudar, eso se lo he dicho ya, ¿vale?","e":"We're not moving in, I told her that, OK?","s":"ope